  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "把符文分别嵌入轻击、重击、技能和闪避四类动作槽位，用动作映射直接定义战斗流派",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Based on 4 basic actions: light attack , heavy attack , skill and dodge , you will assign runes in your weapon among slots of these 4 actions to build your battle style.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2816940/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "死亡会丢失武器及其全部符文，但后续挑战仍有机会重新找到这把遗失装备",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "If you die in a fight, the weapon is also lost with all the runes inlay. Your can start another challenge and if lucky enough, you could find the lost weapon.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2816940/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "无论胜败，本局宝石回到天堂后都会化为尘埃，再用于解锁永久强化",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Win or lose, when you reborn back to heaven, all the gems you collect along the way will turn to dust. Make use of these dust to unlock permanent upgrade.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2816940/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
